This directory holds Territorium's own brand assets. None of them come from
OpenFront: the OpenFront proprietary assets that shipped here upstream have
been removed and replaced.

ALL RIGHTS RESERVED (images/, sounds/):
- images/Favicon.svg, images/TerritoriumLogo.svg,
  images/TerritoriumLogoLight.svg, images/Territorium.png,
  images/TerritoriumMark.png — the Territorium name, emblem and logos
- sounds/music/menu-theme.mp3, sounds/music/gameplay.mp3,
  sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3 — original synthesized audio

You may run, build and test the Territorium software containing these assets.
You may NOT extract them for use in another project, or use the Territorium
name or logos to identify another product, without written permission.

THIRD-PARTY (fonts/):
- fonts/ChakraPetch-Bold.ttf — "Chakra Petch", Copyright 2018 The Chakra
  Petch Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  See fonts/OFL.txt.

